SUMMARY:Spring Pops in the Park
DESCRIPTION:Spring Pops at Durham Central Park: Come Out and Play!\nBring a chair or blanket and join the Durham Symphony Orchestra and your Durham neighbors for a free\, family concert of light classics\, jazz\, and “pops” selections in Durham Central Park!   Visit the instrument petting zoo\, enjoy treats from the food trucks or nearby Durham Food Hall\, or bring your favorite picnic from home.  We look forward to kicking back and celebrating the final event of our 50th season with you\, our community\, in the very heart of Durham’s vibrant DIY District!
URL:https://durhamcentralpark.org/upcoming-event/spring-pops-in-the-park/
LOCATION:The Pavilion\, 501 Foster Street\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
END:VEVENT
