SUMMARY:Sacred Fire: A Durham Pentacost Celebration
DESCRIPTION:Sacred Fire: A Durham Pentacost Celebration\nSunday May 24\, 5pm\nDurham Central Park\nMount Level Community Partnership for Racial Justice and DurhamCares invite you to join Sacred Fire on May 24th at Durham Central Park. \nThe event will feature local dance groups\, music ensembles\, community organizations\, kids activities and more. \nRev. Dr. Donna Coletrane Battle will be the featured preacher.
URL:https://durhamcentralpark.org/upcoming-event/sacred-fire-a-durham-pentacost-celebration/
